    "assumptions": "Inlet stream 8 fixed as given: 871 C, 28.3 bara, 240967 kg/h with stated mole fractions. Property package Peng-Robinson assumed suitable for high-T H2/CO/CO2/CH4/H2O/N2 syngas. Unit is a simple DWSIM cooler (SYNGAS_COOLER) from SYNGAS_FROM_REF to SYNGAS_TO_SHIFT with assumed outlet T_out_C=350 C. 350 C assumed as plausible high-temperature-shift inlet because p.96 BFD shows next block is SHIFT REACTORS but gives no temperature, pressure loss, duty, or geometry. Zero syngas-side pressure drop assumed (outlet 28.3 bara) because no loss data available. No utility/steam side modelled per instruction to model net syngas-side cooling only. Duty (~100749 kW) is computed, not specified. No tuning to withheld stream 9 values.",
